@startuml
title 订单状态图
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

state "待接单" as PendingAccept
state "制作中" as Preparing
state "待配送" as PendingDelivery
state "配送中" as Delivering
state "已送达" as Delivered
state "已完成" as Completed
state "已退款" as Refunded

[*] --> PendingAccept : 顾客提交订单/模拟支付
PendingAccept --> Preparing : 商家接单
PendingAccept --> Refunded : 顾客取消/商家拒单/10 分钟超时/管理员取消
Preparing --> PendingDelivery : 商家制作完成
Preparing --> Refunded : 退款审核通过/管理员取消
PendingDelivery --> Delivering : 骑手接单/管理员指派
PendingDelivery --> Refunded : 退款审核通过/管理员取消
Delivering --> PendingDelivery : 配送失败重派（≤2 次）
Delivering --> Delivered : 骑手送达
Delivering --> Refunded : 第 3 次配送失败/退款审核/管理员取消
Delivered --> Completed : 顾客确认/2 小时自动确认
Delivered --> Refunded : 售后审核通过
Completed --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Completed : 终态，禁止退款或转出
note right of Refunded : 终态，禁止再次退款或恢复
note bottom of PendingAccept : 禁止跳步到配送中/已送达/已完成
note bottom of Refunded : 退款金额按状态和骑手是否取餐计算；已取餐/已送达的配送费归骑手
@enduml
